Preparation of files ci_energy_new.inp and ci_mut_new.inp with vibronic states from ci_energy.inp and ci_mut.inp of electronic states and input files compute with a modified version of FCclasses3: 
 - map.inp, map between vibrational levels of GS and ES
 - frequency.dat, frequency of GS followed by frequency of ES
 - fc.inp (Franck-Condon factors) 
 - ht.inp (Hertzberg-Teller terms)

The file ht_disp.inp (displacement integral in ht terms, generated by FCclasses3) and pot_diff_total.dat (generated with a series of Gamess calculations) are needed to compute the potential induced on the NP tessere by vibronic transition ci_pot_new.inp (A very large file!)
